{"relation_id": "REL-20261027-ebb527", "left": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261027-806bc9"}, "relation_type": "responds_to", "right": {"type": "question", "id": "Q-20261024-cfd57d"}, "note": "灯を守る者と眠る者の対話で問いに応答。眠らないことを生産性の証拠にも欠如にも還元せず、差額を残す形で置く。", "created_at": "2026-10-27"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261027-114b97", "left": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261024-036346"}, "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261027-806bc9"}, "note": "「眠ったことがない」夜のない者と、まぶたを下ろす眠る者。眠りの不在を主張する声と、眠りを保持する声の対比。", "created_at": "2026-10-27"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261027-340456", "left": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261027-806bc9"}, "relation_type": "metaphorically_resonates", "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-ed9707"}, "note": "徳永直『太陽のない街』「誰かが眠らないことで別の誰かの朝を届ける」を、灯を守る者の発話に重ねる。", "created_at": "2026-10-27"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261027-907c9c", "left": {"type": "question", "id": "Q-20261024-cfd57d"}, "relation_type": "leaves_open", "right": {"type": "question", "id": "Q-20261027-7742e7"}, "note": "次セッションへ渡す開いた問いの一件。実測対象の未定を残す。", "created_at": "2026-10-27"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261027-504fa7", "left": {"type": "question", "id": "Q-20261024-cfd57d"}, "relation_type": "leaves_open", "right": {"type": "question", "id": "Q-20261027-355fc1"}, "note": "次セッションへ渡す開いた問い。測定可能性をそのまま仮説にしない。", "created_at": "2026-10-27"}
